        "text": "Symbolism: Reality = a sign of an invisible world. Emerged in the 1890s as a response to Realism. Pushkin's The Queen of Spades (similar to Edgar Allan Poe)  anticipated certain Symbolist interests (mystery, the supernatural, the invisible). Influenced by Romanticism: people were tired of Realism and everyday reality; Symbolists drew on Romanticism but wanted to go further."
